// stock-quote: which sample runtime may call it.
//
// Rendered by terraform/workloads/modules/sample_tools with the gateway ARN
// and the sample runtimes' assumed-role principals. Default-deny engine: a
// runtime not permitted here cannot call getQuote and does not see it.
//
// No input constraint beyond "a symbol is given": the upstream validates
// tickers, the OpenAPI schema bounds the shape, and the key's own plan bounds
// the rate. The lesson of this tool is the credential path, not the input.
%{ for id, principal in principals ~}
permit(
  principal == AgentCore::IamEntity::"${principal}",
  action == AgentCore::Action::"${target}___getQuote",
  resource == AgentCore::Gateway::"${gateway_arn}"
) when {
  context.input has symbol
};
%{ endfor ~}
